{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/8447-paramorphs-is-there-a-decision-already","id":8447,"title":"Paramorphs... is there a decision already?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-11T16:21:20-08:00","id":8447,"title":"Paramorphs... is there a decision already?","content":"See, I still don't know... does the current developers already decided if Talents/Daredevils are indeed something &quot;more than human&quot; (like Mercer), or no, they are &quot;ordinary&quot; humans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T18:09:41-08:00","id":8511,"title":"","content":"Must resist. Rolls willpower and fails.<br /> <br /> Not that I'm aware of<br /> <br /> . I personally have always viewed Paramorphs/Talents/Daredevils as Humans that are the culmination of human evolution being able to unconsciously manipulate the quantum and noetic medium to &quot;power&quot; their abilities. This unconscious manipulation is the various powers that they have. They appear ordinary but yet what they do and their inventions which are radical upgrades to existing technology can not be duplicated by a true human. Note this does not make humans worthless it just makes them below the norm of an advanced human I think a decent example of what I mean is Dr. Julian Bashir on Deep Space 9. Or in a darker vein Khan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T18:42:38-08:00","id":8528,"title":"","content":"Yes, they\u2019ve decided. No, they haven\u2019t told anyone what their decision is.<br /> <br /> Note that even in the old Trinity Universe, there was never anything that officially connected \u201cparamorphs\u201d to daredevils. Yes, one of the main developers held to that theory and pushed it in his Trinity material (which was never officially published); but the other developer held that Max Mercer was the <i>only</i> paramorph, and that daredevils were \u201cmerely\u201d talented baselines, a position that <i>he</i> pushed in his (officially published) Aberrant and Adventure! material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 11-11-2013, 09:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T21:05:15-08:00","id":8586,"title":"","content":"There's a lot of things in the Trinity universe (speaking as a fan here, not a writer) that greatly benefit from a shared vision. Having a cohesive link between Aberrant and Trinity is the biggest one to my eye, but paramorphs and Daredevils are another. Having Ian as an over-dev for the Continuum entire is a great way to clear up these little setting issues.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-11T21:10:08-08:00","id":8587,"title":"","content":"It turns out that Talents are ordinary, regular, normal Chromatics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-07T14:40:15-08:00","id":86280,"title":"","content":"Oh, god, Ian... Congratulations, you got m